      "id": "getting-started",
      "title": "Getting started",
      "anchor": "Getting_started",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "getting-started:qz2so4",
          "html": "Talk to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Benedict\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Benedict</a> in a house north-west of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Varrock_lodestone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Varrock lodestone</a>.",
          "text": "Talk to Benedict in a house north-west of the Varrock lodestone.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "✓",
                  "text": "[Accept Quest]"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "all-players",
      "title": "All players",
      "anchor": "All_players",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "all-players:1jdthmt",
          "html": "Travel to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Varrock_Palace\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Varrock Palace</a>. Climb up the north-west staircase twice and then climb up the ladder to the top floor to collect the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fox_pelt_(Benedict%27s_World_Tour)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">fox pelt</a>.",
          "text": "Travel to Varrock Palace. Climb up the north-west staircase twice and then climb up the ladder to the top floor to collect the fox pelt.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "all-players:qzoscx",
          "html": "Head to the roof of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Al_Kharid_Palace\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Al Kharid Palace</a> and collect the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Toffee_apple_(Benedict%27s_World_Tour)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">toffee apple</a>.",
          "text": "Head to the roof of Al Kharid Palace and collect the toffee apple.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "all-players:12yerg",
          "html": "Head to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Het%27s_Oasis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Het&#39;s Oasis</a> and go to the statue in the centre to collect the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Package_(Benedict%27s_World_Tour)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">package</a>.",
          "text": "Head to Het's Oasis and go to the statue in the centre to collect the package.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "all-players:12yerg:1giv1as",
              "html": "Teleport there with a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ring_of_duelling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ring of duelling</a>.",
              "text": "Teleport there with a ring of duelling.",
              "dialogue": [
                {
                  "when": null,
                  "options": [
                    {
                      "key": "1",
                      "text": "Het's Oasis"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "all-players:12yerg:jxq7x4",
              "html": "If you are below 65 Agility, run north around the whirligig pool to cross the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fallen_palm_tree_(Statue_of_Het)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">fallen palm tree</a>, which has no Agility requirement.",
              "text": "If you are below 65 Agility, run north around the whirligig pool to cross the fallen palm tree, which has no Agility requirement.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "all-players:1yr9qlc",
          "html": "Enter the low-level <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Runespan_portal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Runespan portal</a> to collect the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Crystal_(Benedict%27s_World_Tour)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">crystal</a> to the south-west (on the same island you start on).",
          "text": "Enter the low-level Runespan portal to collect the crystal to the south-west (on the same island you start on).",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "all-players:1yr9qlc:10wwvnr",
              "html": "Teleport there with the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Wicked_hood\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">wicked hood</a> or <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Stardust\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">stardust</a>.",
              "text": "Teleport there with the wicked hood or stardust.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "all-players:1fbl3f6",
          "html": "Head to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Mudskipper_Point\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mudskipper Point</a> and head south-west to collect the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Toy_ship_(Benedict%27s_World_Tour)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">toy ship</a>.",
          "text": "Head to Mudskipper Point and head south-west to collect the toy ship.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "all-players:1fbl3f6:3k0ikt",
              "html": "Use a fairy Ring <b>A</b><b>I</b><b>Q</b> or the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Port_Sarim_lodestone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Port Sarim lodestone</a> to teleport there",
              "text": "Use a fairy Ring AIQ or the Port Sarim lodestone to teleport there",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "all-players:4puy8s",
          "html": "Head to the 2<sup>nd</sup> floor (UK) / 3<sup>rd</sup> floor (US) of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lumbridge_Castle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lumbridge Castle</a> and collect a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Pipe_(Benedict%27s_World_Tour)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">pipe</a> by the north stairs.",
          "text": "Head to the 2nd floor (UK) / 3rd floor (US) of Lumbridge Castle and collect a pipe by the north stairs.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "all-players:8tpm17",
          "html": "Head to the west side of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/White_Knights%27_Castle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">White Knights&#39; Castle</a> in <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Falador\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Falador</a>, and climb the stairs to the roof to collect a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Monocle_(Benedict%27s_World_Tour)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">monocle</a>.",
          "text": "Head to the west side of the White Knights' Castle in Falador, and climb the stairs to the roof to collect a monocle.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "all-players:1tidlys",
          "html": "Head to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Beacon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">beacon</a> south of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Paterdomus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Paterdomus</a> to collect a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Scarf_(Benedict%27s_World_Tour)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">scarf</a>.",
          "text": "Head to the beacon south of Paterdomus to collect a scarf.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "all-players:1tidlys:pjl4a5",
              "html": "Teleport there with either the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Skeletal_horror_Teleport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Skeletal horror Teleport</a>, an <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Invitation_box\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">invitation box</a>, a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fort_Forinthry_Teleport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fort Forinthry Teleport</a>, an <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Archaeology_journal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Archaeology journal</a>.",
              "text": "Teleport there with either the Skeletal horror Teleport, an invitation box, a Fort Forinthry Teleport, an Archaeology journal.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "all-players:1tidlys:1rot7ab",
              "html": "Alternatively, teleport there with a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Dig_Site_pendant\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Dig Site pendant</a> to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Varrock_Dig_Site\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Varrock Dig Site</a>.",
              "text": "Alternatively, teleport there with a Dig Site pendant to the Varrock Dig Site.",
              "dialogue": [
                {
                  "when": null,
                  "options": [
                    {
                      "key": "1",
                      "text": "Digsite"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "all-players:ibds5o",
          "html": "Teleport to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ashdale_lodestone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ashdale lodestone</a> and head directly south to collect the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Surgical_mask_(Benedict%27s_World_Tour)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">surgical mask</a>.",
          "text": "Teleport to Ashdale lodestone and head directly south to collect the surgical mask.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        }
      ]
    },
