          "html": "Head to the top floor of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Sorcerer%27s_Tower\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sorcerer&#39;s Tower</a> north-east of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ardougne\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ardougne</a> to collect a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Money_pouch_(Benedict%27s_World_Tour)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">money pouch</a>.",
